  "notes": "Study play. Puck is in our left corner, away from me. The weak-side winger plays the high slot: between their LD (my point) and the net, inside him, stick in the cross-ice lane, able to see both the puck and my man. When it goes D-to-D to my point, I'm stepping out before the pass arrives and take the shot lane. Rebound, our C recovers.",
  "captions": [
    {
      "t_ms": 0,
      "text": "Their RW has it in the far corner. I'm high, inside their LD."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 2500,
      "text": "Their LD slides toward the middle. I stay inside them, seeing both."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 3000,
      "text": "Pass from the corner to their RD at the far point. I step up."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 3800,
      "text": "D-to-D pass to their LD. I step out now, as it leaves."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 4200,
      "text": "Their LD catches it. I'm two meters away, in their shooting lane."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 4800,
      "text": "Shot. Our goalie sees it and saves. Rebound to the near corner."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 5800,
      "text": "Our C gets the puck. I go to my wall for the breakout."
    }
  ]
